# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages (#77).
#
# app.json sets web.output = "single", so the whole app is ONE index.html and
# every path is resolved client-side by Expo Router. Without this, Cloudflare
# looks for a file at /review, finds none, and serves a 404 — which is exactly
# the URL reviewers are given, so the bench would appear broken to everyone
# except whoever tested it by clicking through from the home page.
#
# 200 rather than 301: rewrite, do not redirect. The browser must keep the
# original path so the router can read it.
/*    /index.html   200
